                <note rend="inline" type="source">Marshall Mission Files, Lot 54–D270:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">General Marshall to Colonel Marshall S. Carter </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Nanking</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-09-29">29 September 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1579. Second solution where equipment is retained by United States Reurad 81589
                    for subsequent declaration as surplus and sale to Chinese Government appears
                    most workable here also.</p>
            </div>
